One thing to note is that when building rApache on linux, the path to
libR.so is encoded into mod_R.so via the linker flag -rpath.

Jeff

On Tue, Aug 31, 2010 at 4:16 PM, Robert M. Flight <rfli...@gmail.com> wrote:
> Yeah, ok we figured out it was a path problem in not having the
> correct path variable set. What tripped us up is one of the builds
> worked when we moved the file, and then things went really flaky.
